| **Traffic Volume** | Commands produce small requests; exfiltration produces asymmetric responses |
| **Certificate Anomalies** | Self-signed or invalid SSL certificates on HTTPS C2 |

### Host-Level Detection

| Indicator | Location |
|-----------|----------|
| **Unusual processes** | Process creation logs (Sysmon Event ID 1) |
| **Network connections** | Netstat equivalents, EDR telemetry |
| **Scheduled tasks** | Windows Task Scheduler, cron jobs |
